  "description": "The target audience consists of individuals who hold anti-Turkish sentiment, are politically aligned against Recep Tayyip Erdoğan, and are familiar with or receptive to dehumanizing political rhetoric. This community may include supporters of opposition parties in Turkey or abroad, individuals with Islamophobic views, and those who engage in hate speech targeting Turkish political leaders. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who use racist and dehumanizing metaphors to vilify political opponents, particularly those perceived as 'foreign' or 'monstrous'.",
